$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Pender, Mark J.; Carroll, Patrick J.; Sneddon, Larry G.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2001), 123(49), 12222-12231

