$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 4. Asymmetric Rhodium-Directed anti-Markovnikov Regioselective
Boracyclopentannulation General Procedure: A 10 mL oven-dried Schlenk
flask was charged with the appropriate NHC-BH3 (0.125 mmol),
[Rh(nbd)2]BF4 (2.5 mg, 6.2 μmol, 5 mol%) and (S)-Xylyl-MeO-BIPHEP (3.6
mg, 6.2 μmol, 5 mol%) under argon. Then, dry degassed dichloromethane (1
mL) was added and the mixture was stirred at room temperature under argon
for 2 minutes. The crude product was filtered through a short plug of
silica gel using dichloromethane (10 mL) as eluent to give the desired
cyclic NHC-borane. The title compound was filtered through a short plug
of silica gel using dichloromethane (10 mL) as eluent to give 2a in 84%
yield as colorless solid. m.p. 83 °C 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm)
0.81-1.32 (m, 2H), 1.15 (d, 3H, , 3J = 6.1 Hz), 1.32-2.44 (m, 3H), 3.55
(dd, 1H, 2J = 10.8 Hz, 3J = .5 Hz), 4.17 (dd, 1H, 2J = 10.8 Hz, 3J = 8.3
Hz), 7.00 (d, 1H, 3J = 2.0 Hz), 7.30 (d, 1H, 3J = 2.0 Hz), 7.34 (m, 1H),
7.42- 7.50 (m, 2H), 7.69-7.76 (m, 2H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm)
21.8, 25.8(HMQC), 58.6, 117.2, 120.2, 120.9, 127.3, 129.4, 138. 11B NMR
(128 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm) -21.1 (t, 1JB-H = 90.3 Hz).HRMS (ES, [M+Li]+)
calcd for [C12H15BLiN2]+: 205.1482; found: 205.1477 FT-IR (ATR) ν (cm-1)
3134 (w), 3116 (w), 2920 (w), 2852 (w), 2811 (w), 2274 (m), 2217 (m),
1598 (m), 1500 (s), 1477 (w), 1463 (w), 1425 (w), 1413 (w), 1321 (w),
1298 (w), 1285 (w), 1215 (w), 1167 (w), 1149 (w), 1089 (w), 1074 (w),
1047 (w), 1030 (w), 918 (w), 899 (w), 756 (s), 736 (s), 709 (m), 690 (s),
641 (w), 618 (w), 588 (w), 531 (w), 486 (w), 465 (w), 404 (w).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
