stirred for 15 min. Upon addition of ethylvinylether (36 μL, 0.37 mmol)
at room temperature a white solid began to precipitate. After the
reaction mixture has been stirred for 24 hours, the solid was isolated
via cannula filtration and washed twice with pentane (2 mL). Removal of
all volatiles in vacuo yielded 21 (204 mg). 21, yield 84% Anal. Calc. for
C36H34BF10P: C, 60.52; H, 4.80. Found C, 60.23; H, 4.71. 1H NMR (500 MHz,
298 K, C6D6) δ = 6.46 (2H, d, 4JPH = 4.0 Hz, m-MesB), 6.39 (2H, d, 4JPH =
